{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/advanced/ssr-hydration","title":"SSR and hydration","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"ssr-and-hydration","children":[{"t":"text","text":"SSR and hydration"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Craft can render a complete application to deterministic HTML on the server,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"transfer its serializable state, and then attach the browser runtime to the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"existing DOM. This runtime path does not require the Craft compiler."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use it when"}]},{"t":"text","text":" the first response must contain useful HTML without rebuilding"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the same component tree during browser startup."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"render-one-isolated-request","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Render one isolated request"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"renderCraft"},{"t":"text","text":" creates a new platform, injector, primitive registry, in-memory"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"history, and storage pair for every call. Do not reuse its injector between"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"requests."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { renderCraft } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/component'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { appConfig } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'./app.config'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"controller"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"new","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"AbortController","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"rendered"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"await","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"renderCraft","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  config: appConfig,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  url: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'/dashboard?page=2'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  signal: controller.signal,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  timeoutMs: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"5_000","kind":"number"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"new","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"Response","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"`<!doctype html><html><body>${","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"rendered","kind":"string"},{"text":".","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"html","kind":"string"},{"text":"}</body></html>`","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    headers: { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'content-type'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'text/html; charset=utf-8'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The result separates "},{"t":"code","text":"rootHtml"},{"t":"text","text":" and the transfer "},{"t":"code","text":"snapshot"},{"t":"text","text":"; "},{"t":"code","text":"html"},{"t":"text","text":" combines"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"both. "},{"t":"code","text":"renderToString(component, options)"},{"t":"text","text":" is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the smaller API when no application config is needed."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"All app initializers are run before the server render. Aborting the request"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"rejects pending SSR work with the signal reason. A blocking render that exceeds"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"timeoutMs"},{"t":"text","text":" rejects with "},{"t":"code","text":"CraftSsrTimeoutError"},{"t":"text","text":" and lists the pending sources."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"A route policy may set a shorter "},{"t":"code","text":"timeoutMs"},{"t":"text","text":" for the sources it blocks."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"hydrate-the-existing-dom","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Hydrate the existing DOM"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Serve the generated "},{"t":"code","text":"<craft-root>"},{"t":"text","text":", style element, and transfer script without"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"changing them. The browser entry point then uses the same app config. "},{"t":"code","text":"startCraft"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"chooses hydration when the SSR marker is present and falls back to a normal"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"client mount when the page was not rendered by Craft SSR:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { startCraft } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/component'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { appConfig } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'./app.config'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"app"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"startCraft","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ config: appConfig });","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Hydration restores the snapshot before creating primitives, claims elements,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"text markers, and block boundaries by their structural keys, and attaches"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"bindings and listeners. A resolved transferred query therefore does not issue"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the same initial request again. The transfer script is removed after a successful first pass."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Call "},{"t":"code","text":"app.destroy()"},{"t":"text","text":" when the application host is removed. Pass "},{"t":"code","text":"host"},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"snapshot"},{"t":"text","text":", or "},{"t":"code","text":"onMismatch"},{"t":"text","text":" when the defaults are not appropriate."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use "},{"t":"code","text":"hydrateCraft"},{"t":"text","text":" directly when the application needs to force hydration or"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"pass hydration-specific options."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"choose-what-ssr-does-with-pending-data","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Choose what SSR does with pending data"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The boundary that owns the pending UI owns its SSR policy. A query still only"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"describes data and its loader."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"div","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"UserList","kind":"function"},{"text":"()).","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"pipe","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"pendingNode","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    ssr: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'block'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"fallback","kind":"function"},{"text":": () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"UserListSkeleton","kind":"function"},{"text":"(),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The three modes are:"}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"Mode"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Server action"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Initial HTML"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"code","text":"block"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Starts and awaits the suspended source"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Resolved content and query snapshot"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"fallback"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Does not await the source"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Boundary fallback"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"client"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Does not start the source"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Explicit browser-owned shell or fallback"}]]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"client"},{"t":"text","text":" requires an explicit fallback in the catch-all form. An exhaustive"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"boundary already supplies explicit source fallbacks."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A route can provide the page default:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"craftRoute","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'dashboard'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  path: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'dashboard'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"loadComponent","kind":"function"},{"text":": () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'./dashboard'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ssr: { mode: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'block'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The nearest local "},{"t":"code","text":"pendingNode"},{"t":"text","text":" wins over the route policy. A read that"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"suspends without either policy fails with"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"CraftUnhandledSsrResolutionError"},{"t":"text","text":"; Craft never silently skips the loader or"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"waits forever. Reloading queries keep rendering their previous value and do"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"not suspend."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"structural-identity-and-local-recovery","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Structural identity and local recovery"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Hydration keys come from the component and template path, not from a global"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"counter or random id. Static children use their logical position, blocks use a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"stable boundary segment, and "},{"t":"code","text":"forNode"},{"t":"text","text":" entries use the declared business key."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Server and client must therefore execute the same template structure and use"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"stable "},{"t":"code","text":"forNode"},{"t":"text","text":" keys."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"If a key is absent, a tag differs, text changed, or a dynamic branch no longer"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"matches, Craft recreates that local subtree and keeps compatible siblings. In"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"development it also reports a "},{"t":"code","text":"HydrationMismatchError"},{"t":"text","text":" containing the key,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"expected node, actual node, and reason."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"transfer-snapshot-rules","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Transfer snapshot rules"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Only values composed of JSON primitives, plain objects, and arrays are"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"transferred. Functions, "},{"t":"code","text":"bigint"},{"t":"text","text":", class instances, and cycles fail explicitly."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Unreadable or absent primitive values are omitted. Query entries include their"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"status, resolved value when present, and a plain "},{"t":"code","text":"{ name, message }"},{"t":"text","text":" error when"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the runtime exposes one."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"serializeCraftTransferSnapshot"},{"t":"text","text":" escapes "},{"t":"code","text":"<"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":">"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"&"},{"t":"text","text":", U+2028, and U+2029, so"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the JSON cannot close its "},{"t":"code","text":"application/json"},{"t":"text","text":" script element. Treat the snapshot"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"as application data nevertheless: do not place secrets in state that reaches"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the browser."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"current-scope","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Current scope"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"This first runtime release covers full-page hydration, deterministic HTML,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"CSS collection, state/query transfer, async boundary policies, keyed "},{"t":"code","text":"forNode"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"recovery, and local mismatch remounts. Streaming, resumability, islands,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"cross-boundary event replay, compiler-generated renderers, and a direct"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"server-function transport are later work."}]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"render-one-isolated-request","text":"Render one isolated request"},{"level":2,"id":"hydrate-the-existing-dom","text":"Hydrate the existing DOM"},{"level":2,"id":"choose-what-ssr-does-with-pending-data","text":"Choose what SSR does with pending data"},{"level":2,"id":"structural-identity-and-local-recovery","text":"Structural identity and local recovery"},{"level":2,"id":"transfer-snapshot-rules","text":"Transfer snapshot rules"},{"level":2,"id":"current-scope","text":"Current scope"}]}